T*
() Tj
T*
(10. CONCLUSION) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The thesis established a fabrication-aware optical-design workflow for IZO/Ag/IZO) Tj
T*
(transparent conducting multilayers. It identified promising thickness combinations and) Tj
T*
(clarified the physical assumptions behind their simulated performance. More importantly, the) Tj
T*
(work developed a research perspective in which modelling and fabrication are not separate) Tj
T*
(stages. Simulations reveal mechanisms and guide experiments; experiments determine which) Tj
T*
(assumptions are realistic and provide the data needed to improve the next model.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project also marked a shift in research interest from photovoltaic electrode) Tj
T*
(optimisation toward the broader physics of light-matter interaction, multilayer photonics) Tj
T*
(and nanostructured optical materials.) Tj
